{%- comment -%}
  The numbered step the narrative sections open with: a navy disc, then the
  mono label beside it. Three sections share it, so it lives here rather than
  being rebuilt per section.

  Accepts: number, label.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="section-step">
  {%- if number != blank -%}
    <span class="section-step__badge" aria-hidden="true">{{ number }}</span>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if label != blank -%}
    <p class="section-eyebrow section-step__label label-sm">{{ label }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
